# Run with --no-seed --foreign conversation. Focus starts in the terminal;
# F3 switches directly to the compressed conversation and back.
Sleep 8s
Type "/"
Sleep 1s
Type "conversation "
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Type "OR"
Sleep 3s
Screenshot {{SHOTS}}/01-hotkey-compressed-focus.png
Sleep 1s
Escape
Type "OR"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Type "OR"
Sleep 2s
